I\'m focusing on the online/offline indicators, the \"Live API\" label\'s styling, and their responsiveness. I\'m working to maintain the theme\'s aesthetics, ensuring clarity and visual appeal within the frosted glass design. I\'m focusing on the pulsing animation, and updating the gradient background.\n\n\n**Enhancing the Visuals**\n\nI\'m now enhancing the Orb visualizer, implementing a layered animated effect for the connection status. I\'m focusing on layered `motion.div` elements, featuring animated pulses, rotating borders, and an inner glow. The gradients and blend modes are tailored for the frosted glass theme\'s aesthetic.\n\n\n\n**Optimizing the Animation**\n\nI\'m now optimizing the animation of the \"Orb\" connection status button within the frosted glass theme. Specifically, I\'m refining the button\'s visual effects, including hover and tap interactions, gradients, and border styling. I\'m ensuring a smooth transition and visually appealing response that aligns with the established aesthetic.\n\n\n**Refining the Connection Status**\n\nI\'m now refining the connection status animation within the Frosted Glass theme. I\'m focusing on the \"Orb\'s\" status display, specifically its visual effects and interactions. I\'m ensuring smooth transitions and a visually appealing response that aligns with the aesthetic. I am working on the mic button, refining it to match the established theme.\n\n\n\n**Analyzing the Components**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the existing code snippets to understand the components and how I can integrate the new theme. My focus is on the given system logs section, ensuring the visual effects and interactions align perfectly. I am trying to determine the correct location to append the theme, and how to maintain the existing functionality.\n\n\n**Integrating the Logs**\n\nI\'m now integrating the log section into the frosted glass theme, focusing on styling. I\'m applying the background and border styling, and I\'m ensuring it aligns with the overall aesthetic. I\'m focusing on the scrollbar, and the error indicators, and I\'m updating both the display for mobile and larger displays. I want to make sure the logs are easily readable, while maintaining the frosted glass theme\'s style.\n\n\n**Updating the Indicators**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the existing log indicators with the frosted glass theme. I\'ve analyzed the current formatting and am refactoring the existing indicators to align with the new aesthetic, paying close attention to the error, success, and info styles, updating the background, font, and border. I\'m focusing on the scroll bar.\n\n\n\n"
